            "action_name": {
              "value": "Chupar"
            },
            "action_description": {
              "value": "Requirements: The chupacabra has a creature grabbed\n\nThe chupacabra sucks blood from the grabbed creature. The chupacabra gains the quickened condition for 1 minute and can use the extra action only for Strike and Stride actions. A chupacabra can't use Chupar again while it is quickened in this way. A creature that has its blood drained by a chupacabra is drained 1 until it receives healing (of any kind or amount)."
            },
